    <name>
      <text>1.1 Calculator and significant figures</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>(a)  Use your calculator to work out the value of </p>
<p>\(\displaystyle \frac{{@aa@}-{@bb@}}{{@cc@}}+\sqrt{{@dd@}}\)</p> 
<p>Write down all the figures on your calculator display.</p>
<p>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>
<p align="right"><b>(2)</b></p>
<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p>(b)  Write your answer to part (a) correct to 1 significant figure.</p>
<p>[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</p>
<p align="right"><b>(1)</b></p>
<p>[[feedback:prt2]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
